# Changelog — DCTR

All notable changes to the DCTR project and its Whitepaper are documented in this file.

---

## [v3.2] — 2026-08-25

### Changed
- Burn percentage corrected to actual on-chain figure: 25.25% (252,499,859 DCTR), replacing the previous ~50% citation
- Trophy & Presidential Reserve first distribution re-timed from month 3 to month 6 post-launch, to avoid compounding sell-pressure with the Core Treasury's own first unlock
- Trophy Reserve distribution model changed from a fixed top-down percentage split to a merit-based, discretionary allocation model

### Added
- Forward Burn Policy: 9% of every monthly unlock from the Core Locked Treasury is permanently burned
- Burn-to-Mint NFT Trophies mechanism
- Unclaimed Trophy Burn mechanism (seasonal reward pools)
- Founder's Exceptional Decree (discretionary burn event) with three guardrails
- Official Links & On-Chain Verification section (GitHub, Solscan, Dexscreener, Streamflow)
- Total lock duration explicitly stated: 18 months (cliff to final unlock)
- LICENSE, SECURITY.md, CHANGELOG.md, TOKENOMICS.md, CONTRIBUTING.md added to repository

### Fixed
- Removed internally inconsistent Core Locked Treasury figure; corrected to 376,000,000 DCTR allocated / ~370,000,000 DCTR actively locked

